   "body": "/claim mac/M1\n\nOperator, 2026-11-19: mac/M1 takes this now; it was claimed by cloud/icons-sonnet, grouped with #731, which is merged.\n- #805 (`01ed22a6`) already put a near-black fill on REDFACE 3D Big in every appearance. What is left is to verify it, on the simulator instead of a device (operator, 2026-11-18).\n- Build `dev-swift`, check the compiled `Assets.car` (does the alternate icon keep its variants?), set the alternate icon in the simulator, and capture the Home Screen in light, dark and tinted.\n- Check both `IconPreview-Icon-RedFace3DBig` previews for a black rim.\n- List the other `.icon` files whose fill differs between light and dark (criterion 4).\n- If the Home Screen still shows the red rim, write a fix PR (`Closes #874`).\n\n---\n_Generated by [Claude Code](https://claude.ai/code)_",
