   "updated_at": "2026-11-19T06:18:31Z",
   "body": "**Follow-up (mac/M1, 2026-11-19, Mac freed):** I re-ran the `setAlternateIconName` path that hung earlier. On a headless simulator (no Simulator.app on this Mac), iOS cancels the change with `NSCocoaErrorDomain 3072` in every case I tried:\n- from a hosted test;\n- from the app launched in the foreground, with an unsigned build;\n- the same, with an ad-hoc signed build.\n\nSo the alternate-icon switch cannot be checked here. What stands is the earlier evidence: the compiled `Assets.car` has the same three renditions for the alternate icon as for the primary one, and the Home Screen shows the black rim when the icon is compiled as primary. The issue stays closed. The switch from the picker on a device stays on #893's general review list.\n\n---\n_Generated by [Claude Code](https://claude.ai/code)_\n",
